 rocky backstage and  shoves Mickey causing the old man to  have a heart attack rocky loses the  championship fight but lets Mickey  believe that he won and the boxing  trainer dies peacefully backstage after  witnessing the loss - clubber Creed  takes rocky to LA and teaches him to  fight using a different style of boxing  with Apollo's help Rocky finds the eye  of the tiger and defeats Lang in a  rematch  in 1985 a Russian boxer named Ivan Drago  battles Apollo Creed in an exhibition  that results in the highly trained  Russian killing Creed in the ring won in  revenge rocky challenges Drago to a  fight which takes place in Russia a  grieving Balboa is accompanied by Paulie  and Duke Apollo's former trainer over  time Duke solidifies himself as one of  Rocky's best trainers getting the  champion back into shape with a fierce  training regimen  after a hard-won fight the Italian  stallion knocks Drago out in the 15th  round right in front of the Soviet  premier rocky 5 finds a champion  struggling with retirement and  fatherhood mismanaged finances has led  to the balboa family losing their riches  and rocky learns that he's got a major  brain injury forcing him to lay down the  gloves rocky reopens Mickey's gym and  lives vicariously through a young  up-and-comer named Tommy Gunn  unfortunately the fulfillment he gets  out of training Gunn causes rocky to  neglect his real son it's up to Adrienne  and Paul II to ground rocky and show him  what's important  after a stunning betrayal by Gunn rocky  focuses on fatherhood and wins back the  affection of his son  Thanks culminates in a brutal street  fight with Tommy after he punches Paulie  in the face rocky takes Tommy on in the  streets and sends a young champ packing  after beating Tommy Gunn rocky  disappears from the boxing world and  opens an Italian restaurant however the  biggest change in his life is the death  of his beloved wife Adrienne from cancer  Rocky's life changes after ESPN  broadcasts a computer-si